  {
   "id": "re-village@patch-2022-10-19",
   "gameId": "re-village",
   "displayName": "How to resolve the bug introduced by the recent patch for Resident Evil Village",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-10-19T09:47:24.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The most recent patch, distributed on October 14, 2022, led to some unexpected behavior preventing the launch of the game. A method has been found to resolve this issue using the software on your PC. If you have been affected by this issue, please try following the steps below.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We apologize for the inconvenience, and appreciate your cooperation and understanding.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "----------",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please locate the Resident Evil Village listing within your Steam Library.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Right-click it, and select \"Properties.\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You will be taken to a screen resembling the attached image.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please select the Additional Content (DLC) tab, and uncheck the box located beside the following DLC items:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resident Evil Village - Winters' Expansion",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resident Evil Village - Street Wolf Outfit",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "----------",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game should now work as normal.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once the Winters' Expansion has launched on October 28, please re-enable the DLC items by returning to that screen and re-checking the box for the items.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The patch distributed on October 14, 2022 included some updates to the game's security features, which may conflict with third-party software. We do not guarantee functionality of any of our products, including this game, when used with third-party software. If you have been using any such software, please try removing all related files and then running the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please understand that any saved data created while using third-party software may not function properly even after all software and related files have been removed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once again, we apologize for the inconvenience to you, our devoted fans.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sincerely, the Resident Evil Village Dev Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
